{"_id":"EBeSJpJeq672WnTO","name":"Tier 1 Melee Critical Hits (Levels 1-4)","description":"Critical hit effects for melee attacks at Tier 1 (Levels 1-4). Effects are relatively mild for novice adventurers.","img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-sword-slashing-red.webp","formula":"1d100","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"results":[{"_id":"W72uTlR1s6K6XB38","type":0,"text":"Nothing Special - Your critical strike deals damage as normal, but no additional effect occurs.","img":"icons/svg/d20-highlight.svg","weight":25,"range":[1,25],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"none"}}},{"_id":"XkexSuf9kpzaE9vA","type":0,"text":"Rattled - The jarring impact throws off your foe's concentration. They have disadvantage on their next ability check.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":8,"range":[26,33],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"ability.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Rattled","duration":0}}},{"_id":"gpMzmcVpMxr1FMsy","type":0,"text":"Painful Strike - The searing pain gnaws at your foe's focus. They have disadvantage on concentration saves until the end of their next turn.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":7,"range":[34,40],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"concentration","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Painful Strike","duration":1}}},{"_id":"AFKhpF1EwIVfIW3j","type":0,"text":"Ringing Skull - Your blow slams against their head and leaves their ears ringing. They are deafened until they receive healing.","img":"icons/svg/daze.svg","weight":7,"range":[41,47],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"deafened","duration":-1}}},{"_id":"4Th8WJ6fm2S73z0f","type":0,"text":"Armor Dent - Your strike dents a plate of the target's armor. They take -1 AC until they spend an action to bend it back into shape.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":6,"range":[48,53],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"ac","penaltyValue":-1,"duration":-1}}},{"_id":"vM7s4z2rzSuXNFB4","type":0,"text":"Disorienting Hit - Your blow leaves the target seeing stars. They have disadvantage on their next saving throw.","img":"icons/svg/daze.svg","weight":6,"range":[54,59],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"save.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Disoriented","duration":0}}},{"_id":"jm1TgkRXIKhcM8cr","type":0,"text":"Dazed - Your devastating hit leaves your target reeling. They have disadvantage on their next attack roll.","img":"icons/svg/daze.svg","weight":5,"range":[60,64],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Dazed","duration":0}}},{"_id":"HO4r3VIlWfKCfA0l","type":0,"text":"Knockdown - The force of your blow sends your target sprawling. They are knocked prone.","img":"icons/svg/falling.svg","weight":5,"range":[65,69],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"prone","duration":0}}},{"_id":"NEOXokk7lYHsUpoK","type":0,"text":"Crippled Arm - Your strike mangles the muscles of their weapon arm. They take -2 to attack rolls until they receive healing.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":5,"range":[70,74],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"attack","penaltyValue":-2,"duration":-1}}},{"_id":"Nrgd2O5mgKJKtTGR","type":0,"text":"Shield Sundered - Your strike splinters the target's shield or buckles their armor. They take -2 AC until it is repaired with Mending or smith's tools.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":4,"range":[75,78],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"ac","penaltyValue":-2,"duration":-1}}},{"_id":"Vy9slo4W7vyDud11","type":0,"text":"Follow-Through - Your perfect follow-through opens the way for another blow. You have advantage on your next melee attack against the target.","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","weight":4,"range":[79,82],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"attack.mwak","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Follow-Through","duration":0}}},{"_id":"UogNOaTrbk4RAiG1","type":0,"text":"Driving Slam - You drive your full weight into the blow. The target must succeed on a DC 11 Strength save or be knocked prone.","img":"icons/svg/falling.svg","weight":4,"range":[83,86],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"str","effectCondition":"prone","duration":0}}},{"_id":"oKPNWzJxVy4uQZd8","type":0,"text":"Bleeding Wound - Your strike opens a nasty gash that bleeds freely. The target takes an extra weapon die of damage.","img":"icons/svg/blood.svg","weight":4,"range":[87,90],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1W","damageType":"weapon"}}},{"_id":"4qiBEaI3noe7wO6w","type":0,"text":"Perfect Strike - A masterful blow that fills your foe with dread. The target is frightened of you until the end of their next turn.","img":"icons/svg/terror.svg","weight":3,"range":[91,93],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"frightened","duration":1}}},{"_id":"pNc0uMch7YFROTRl","type":0,"text":"Blood in the Eyes - Your blow splashes blood across the target's face. They are blinded until the end of their next turn.","img":"icons/svg/blind.svg","weight":3,"range":[94,96],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"blinded","duration":0}}},{"_id":"MN95SKnWsd0tWvJN","type":0,"text":"Exposed Weakness - Your keen eye spots an opening in the target's guard. Attacks against them have advantage until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","weight":2,"range":[97,98],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"grants","effectName":"Exposed Weakness","duration":1}}},{"_id":"RCa0oB6ay2fieopu","type":0,"text":"Gut Wound - Your blade tears into the target's belly. They must succeed on a DC 11 Constitution save or be poisoned until they receive healing.","img":"icons/svg/poison.svg","weight":2,"range":[99,100],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"con","effectCondition":"poisoned","duration":-1}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"tier":1,"attackType":"melee","resultType":"crit"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1785615948581,"modifiedTime":1785615948581,"lastModifiedBy":"build-script"}}
{"_id":"KX1K9s2NattEyUn0","name":"Tier 1 Melee Fumbles (Levels 1-4)","description":"Fumble effects for melee attacks at Tier 1 (Levels 1-4). Effects are relatively mild for novice adventurers.","img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-sword-slashing-red.webp","formula":"1d100","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"results":[{"_id":"MTc9kAVYlAX3xp9a","type":0,"text":"Nothing Special - You stumble slightly but recover quickly with no additional penalty.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":25,"range":[1,25],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"none"}}},{"_id":"UiimLNP6uFDrprTZ","type":0,"text":"Weapon Notched - Your blade chips against something hard. You take a -1 penalty to attack rolls until the weapon is repaired.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":8,"range":[26,33],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"attack","penaltyValue":-1,"duration":-1}}},{"_id":"DeHzRALFfkdBDIor","type":0,"text":"Jarred Wrist - You jar your wrist on the botched swing, taking a -2 penalty to attack rolls until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":7,"range":[34,40],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"attack","penaltyValue":-2,"duration":1}}},{"_id":"ivEfRRkRC0B1wCeO","type":0,"text":"Off Your Feet - You lurch off balance and have disadvantage on your next saving throw.","img":"icons/svg/falling.svg","weight":7,"range":[41,47],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"save.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Off Your Feet","duration":0}}},{"_id":"Idx2HTPvycJB2ZYh","type":0,"text":"Off Balance - Your wild swing throws you off balance, giving you disadvantage on your next attack roll.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":6,"range":[48,53],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Off Balance","duration":0}}},{"_id":"FAp0Z3NYRYJogjDc","type":0,"text":"Dropped Guard - You drop your guard, taking a -2 penalty to your AC until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":6,"range":[54,59],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"ac","penaltyValue":-2,"duration":1}}},{"_id":"23UusrKtACKd1JnS","type":0,"text":"Overextended - You overreach and leave yourself open. The next attack against you has advantage.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":5,"range":[60,64],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"grants","effectName":"Overextended","duration":0}}},{"_id":"32fpHYm7LvY7qdGx","type":0,"text":"Weapon Slipped - Your weapon slips in your grip. You have disadvantage on attack rolls until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":5,"range":[65,69],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Weapon Slipped","duration":1}}},{"_id":"GNvcUYucmav3Q3PY","type":0,"text":"Telegraphed Attack - Your clumsy swing telegraphs your intent. The target has advantage on its next saving throw against you.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":5,"range":[70,74],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"save.all","advantageTarget":"grants","effectName":"Telegraphed","duration":0}}},{"_id":"bInIf6UaTWxmOtCY","type":0,"text":"Cut Yourself - The blade bites you on the backswing. You take one weapon die of damage to yourself.","img":"icons/svg/blood.svg","weight":4,"range":[75,78],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1W","damageType":"weapon"}}},{"_id":"pVFRXOow7QUJrBAC","type":0,"text":"Sprawled - You trip over your own feet and fall prone.","img":"icons/svg/falling.svg","weight":4,"range":[79,82],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"prone","duration":0}}},{"_id":"wcEnhLvcmkZBInj1","type":0,"text":"Wrenched Shoulder - You wrench your shoulder on the miss. You have disadvantage on attack rolls until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":4,"range":[83,86],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Wrenched Shoulder","duration":1}}},{"_id":"vODzX3mWXJozx2C5","type":0,"text":"Wide Open - Your reckless attack leaves you wide open. Attacks against you have advantage until the start of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":4,"range":[87,90],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"grants","effectName":"Wide Open","duration":1}}},{"_id":"WwgWFeLLfu53QtAx","type":0,"text":"Rattled - Your fumble rattles your nerve. You are frightened until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/terror.svg","weight":3,"range":[91,93],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"frightened","duration":1}}},{"_id":"ElVtWlyZPU1PQlBg","type":0,"text":"Weapon Flung - Your weapon is wrenched from your grasp and goes spinning away. Roll to see where it lands.","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","weight":3,"range":[94,96],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disarm"}}},{"_id":"AeJEn9IBp9pAaezB","type":0,"text":"Tangled - You tangle in your own straps and gear. You are grappled until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/net.svg","weight":2,"range":[97,98],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"grappled","duration":1}}},{"_id":"FJY6iSm3DK2RY2wd","type":0,"text":"Wild Overswing - You overcommit disastrously. Make a DC 11 Dexterity saving throw or take 1d6 slashing damage and fall prone.","img":"icons/svg/falling.svg","weight":2,"range":[99,100],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"dex","effectCondition":"prone","damageFormula":"1d6","damageType":"slashing"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"tier":1,"attackType":"melee","resultType":"fumble"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1785615948581,"modifiedTime":1785615948581,"lastModifiedBy":"build-script"}}
{"_id":"TFDBCi4ydBwymPgS","name":"Tier 1 Ranged Critical Hits (Levels 1-4)","description":"Critical hit effects for ranged attacks at Tier 1 (Levels 1-4). Effects are relatively mild for novice adventurers.","img":"icons/weapons/bows/longbow-recurve-brown.webp","formula":"1d100","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"results":[{"_id":"DdcWbko6xRpXS8dR","type":0,"text":"Nothing Special - Your critical strike deals damage as normal, but no additional effect occurs.","img":"icons/svg/d20-highlight.svg","weight":25,"range":[1,25],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"none"}}},{"_id":"fYi4pQuYLZLDP4Bv","type":0,"text":"Rattled Target - Your shot startles the target, giving them disadvantage on their next ability check.","img":"icons/svg/daze.svg","weight":8,"range":[26,33],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"ability.all","effectName":"Rattled","duration":0}}},{"_id":"EjzyES8FLvFF5G6Z","type":0,"text":"Eye Threat - The projectile whistles past the target's eyes, giving them disadvantage on their next ranged attack.","img":"icons/svg/eye.svg","weight":7,"range":[34,40],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.rwak","effectName":"Eye Threat","duration":0}}},{"_id":"9UMYjdsFSyUcqFIw","type":0,"text":"Muffled Ears - The shot clips the side of the target's head, leaving them deafened until the wound is treated.","img":"icons/svg/silenced.svg","weight":7,"range":[41,47],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"deafened","duration":-1}}},{"_id":"vu2wzj4eDhqTKIXC","type":0,"text":"Distracting Shot - Your shot forces the target to focus on dodging, giving them disadvantage on their next saving throw.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":6,"range":[48,53],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"save.all","effectName":"Distracted","duration":0}}},{"_id":"k6zxwIkz8SpmzYlb","type":0,"text":"Severed Tendon - Your shot severs a tendon in the target's arm, giving them -2 to attack rolls until they receive healing.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":6,"range":[54,59],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"attack","penaltyValue":-2,"duration":-1}}},{"_id":"4PFPyKLVPiuZWBg1","type":0,"text":"Armor Piercing - Your shot finds a seam in the target's armor, imposing -1 AC until they take an action to reset it.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":5,"range":[60,64],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"ac","penaltyValue":-1,"duration":-1}}},{"_id":"MAnZodKLNmccMqNq","type":0,"text":"Suppressing Shot - A burst of covering fire breaks the target's nerve, giving them disadvantage on attack rolls until the end of their next turn.","img":"icons/svg/net.svg","weight":5,"range":[65,69],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Suppressed","duration":1}}},{"_id":"RQt56uTgGxwyIa55","type":0,"text":"Grit in the Eye - A spray of grit and blood catches the target across the eyes, leaving them blinded until the end of their next turn.","img":"icons/svg/blind.svg","weight":5,"range":[70,74],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"blinded","duration":0}}},{"_id":"OL47A92qBPY66agc","type":0,"text":"Exposed Target - Your shot forces the target to flinch open, granting advantage on attacks against them until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","weight":4,"range":[75,78],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"grants","effectName":"Exposed Target","duration":1}}},{"_id":"niOPvQ1iVukGO7yZ","type":0,"text":"Bleeding Wound - Your projectile leaves a deep gash, dealing an extra weapon die of damage.","img":"icons/svg/blood.svg","weight":4,"range":[79,82],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1W","damageType":"weapon"}}},{"_id":"OmL0SbiuWN4nmiRC","type":0,"text":"Penetrating Shot - The projectile tears clean through muscle, dealing an extra 1d6 piercing damage.","img":"icons/svg/explosion.svg","weight":4,"range":[83,86],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1d6","damageType":"piercing"}}},{"_id":"qlz5Oq2E8ZihJjEV","type":0,"text":"Disarming Shot - Your projectile strikes the target's weapon hand, giving them disadvantage on attack rolls until the end of their next turn.","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","weight":4,"range":[87,90],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","effectName":"Hand Struck","duration":1}}},{"_id":"dZ1VesIJWVJ9li3j","type":0,"text":"Kneecapped - Your shot strikes the target's knee, forcing a DC 11 Dexterity save or be knocked prone.","img":"icons/svg/falling.svg","weight":3,"range":[91,93],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"dex","effectCondition":"prone"}}},{"_id":"QqoLmWQCa6SlC9ko","type":0,"text":"Staggering Blow - The force of the shot staggers the target, forcing a DC 11 Strength save or take 1d6 bludgeoning damage as they are driven back.","img":"icons/svg/thrust.svg","weight":3,"range":[94,96],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"str","damageFormula":"1d6","damageType":"bludgeoning"}}},{"_id":"1TGiMrgniF5AjlV7","type":0,"text":"Punctured Lung - Your shot punctures a lung, forcing a DC 11 Constitution save or be poisoned while the target struggles to breathe.","img":"icons/svg/poison.svg","weight":2,"range":[97,98],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"con","effectCondition":"poisoned"}}},{"_id":"cjif9iNVaUWHyec3","type":0,"text":"Deadly Precision - A masterful shot lands with maximum weapon damage and leaves the target frightened of you until the end of their next turn.","img":"icons/svg/terror.svg","weight":2,"range":[99,100],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"frightened","duration":1}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"tier":1,"attackType":"ranged","resultType":"crit"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1785615948581,"modifiedTime":1785615948581,"lastModifiedBy":"build-script"}}
{"_id":"O0edoGRGyyqXJ8zu","name":"Tier 1 Ranged Fumbles (Levels 1-4)","description":"Fumble effects for ranged attacks at Tier 1 (Levels 1-4). Effects are relatively mild for novice adventurers.","img":"icons/weapons/bows/longbow-recurve-brown.webp","formula":"1d100","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"results":[{"_id":"E31YDNYerTNn2nHM","type":0,"text":"Nothing Special - Your shot goes wide but you recover your composure with no additional penalty.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":25,"range":[1,25],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"none"}}},{"_id":"hmn6aIaGOKbUWEkp","type":0,"text":"Watering Eyes - Your eyes water from the effort and you have disadvantage on your next ability check.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":8,"range":[26,33],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"ability.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Watering Eyes","duration":0}}},{"_id":"jLN4apRNqcsqzuNi","type":0,"text":"Flinch - You flinch at your own misfire and have disadvantage on your next saving throw.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":7,"range":[34,40],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"save.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Flinch","duration":0}}},{"_id":"v1jooSrIjfer8xcc","type":0,"text":"Fouled Aim - Your aim is thrown off and you have disadvantage on your next attack roll.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":7,"range":[41,47],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Fouled Aim","duration":0}}},{"_id":"ZY0dC06ezIRtg65f","type":0,"text":"Snapped String - Your bowstring snaps taut awkwardly and you have disadvantage on ranged attacks until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":6,"range":[48,53],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.rwak","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Snapped String","duration":1}}},{"_id":"pVpBT3bwq6uWjhcv","type":0,"text":"Overdrawn - You overdraw and wrench your form, taking a -2 penalty to attack rolls until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":6,"range":[54,59],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"attack","penaltyValue":-2,"duration":1}}},{"_id":"UovGfeRwNm2dlwvB","type":0,"text":"Recoil Strain - The recoil wrenches your arm; take 1d4 bludgeoning damage.","img":"icons/svg/blood.svg","weight":5,"range":[60,64],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1d4","damageType":"bludgeoning"}}},{"_id":"1I0pgZG7lW2IDCPi","type":0,"text":"Telegraphed Shot - You telegraph your shot and your target has advantage on its next saving throw against you.","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","weight":5,"range":[65,69],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"save.all","advantageTarget":"grants","effectName":"Telegraphed Shot","duration":0}}},{"_id":"PqO4gXrXjIIuJW28","type":0,"text":"Caught Flat - You are caught flat-footed; attacks against you have advantage until the start of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","weight":5,"range":[70,74],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"grants","effectName":"Caught Flat","duration":1}}},{"_id":"f8Vl8kaF6JP41pk4","type":0,"text":"Exposed Flank - Your stance falls apart, leaving a -2 penalty to your AC until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":4,"range":[75,78],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"ac","penaltyValue":-2,"duration":1}}},{"_id":"hZCr3wrdrRg8JmfQ","type":0,"text":"Jammed Solid - Your weapon jams solid and you have disadvantage on attack rolls until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":4,"range":[79,82],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Jammed Solid","duration":1}}},{"_id":"m5CeQzNwnUM1F4uj","type":0,"text":"Dropped Weapon - Your ranged weapon is torn from your hands and goes tumbling away. Roll to see where it lands.","img":"icons/svg/net.svg","weight":4,"range":[83,86],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disarm"}}},{"_id":"Et5iho0VUsrpPsba","type":0,"text":"Off-Balance - You lose your footing; make a DC 11 Dexterity saving throw or fall prone.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":4,"range":[87,90],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"dex","effectCondition":"prone","duration":-1}}},{"_id":"WlcysGMWwnzzzzc3","type":0,"text":"Winded - The strain knocks the wind from you; make a DC 11 Constitution saving throw or take 1d6 bludgeoning damage.","img":"icons/svg/blood.svg","weight":3,"range":[91,93],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"con","damageFormula":"1d6","damageType":"bludgeoning"}}},{"_id":"doaFVl6KSc05nz9J","type":0,"text":"Stinging Rebound - Your shot rebounds and stings you; take 1d6 bludgeoning damage.","img":"icons/svg/blood.svg","weight":3,"range":[94,96],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1d6","damageType":"bludgeoning"}}},{"_id":"DSL7KsX6GwxgZChJ","type":0,"text":"Blinded - Your snapped string lashes across your eyes; you are blinded until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/paralysis.svg","weight":2,"range":[97,98],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"blinded","duration":1}}},{"_id":"hKN7DkxvJ8A6CF2M","type":0,"text":"Self-Impaling Bolt - Your own projectile catches you; take 1d8 bludgeoning damage.","img":"icons/svg/blood.svg","weight":2,"range":[99,100],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1d8","damageType":"bludgeoning"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"tier":1,"attackType":"ranged","resultType":"fumble"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1785615948581,"modifiedTime":1785615948581,"lastModifiedBy":"build-script"}}
{"_id":"sC1dGvJtDd3BMJr4","name":"Tier 1 Spell Critical Hits (Levels 1-4)","description":"Critical hit effects for spell attacks at Tier 1 (Levels 1-4). Effects are relatively mild for novice adventurers.","img":"icons/magic/fire/projectile-fireball-smoke-strong-orange.webp","formula":"1d100","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"results":[{"_id":"aZbh4RYmJJCxlLUn","type":0,"text":"Nothing Special - Your critical spell deals damage as normal, but no additional effect occurs.","img":"icons/svg/d20-highlight.svg","weight":25,"range":[1,25],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"none"}}},{"_id":"v9DogXGzzkDcvQvj","type":0,"text":"Ringing Aura - A piercing arcane tone rings in the target's ears, leaving them deafened.","img":"icons/svg/daze.svg","weight":8,"range":[26,33],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"deafened","duration":-1}}},{"_id":"qybGNDvrDqBMOqbP","type":0,"text":"Spell Feedback - Your spell disrupts the target's concentration. If concentrating, they must make a concentration save with disadvantage.","img":"icons/svg/silenced.svg","weight":7,"range":[34,40],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"concentration","effectName":"Spell Feedback","duration":0}}},{"_id":"ugw9mn1SfOg2jHj8","type":0,"text":"Mental Disruption - Your spell rattles the target's mind. They have disadvantage on their next ability check.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":7,"range":[41,47],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"ability.all","effectName":"Mental Disruption","duration":0}}},{"_id":"0DM8hT4MVVUNBJWG","type":0,"text":"Magical Overload - The target's senses are briefly overwhelmed. They have disadvantage on their next saving throw.","img":"icons/svg/daze.svg","weight":6,"range":[48,53],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"save.all","effectName":"Magical Overload","duration":0}}},{"_id":"RPhedE6WSObJ7jOY","type":0,"text":"Dazzling Spell - Your spell produces a brilliant flash. The target has disadvantage on their next attack roll.","img":"icons/svg/light.svg","weight":6,"range":[54,59],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","effectName":"Dazzled","duration":0}}},{"_id":"ayBJrKYxDWfUZLQm","type":0,"text":"Arcane Burn - Your spell leaves lingering magical energy. Target takes extra force damage equal to the spell's damage die at the start of their next turn.","img":"icons/magic/fire/flame-burning-yellow-orange.webp","weight":5,"range":[60,64],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1S","damageType":"force"}}},{"_id":"vhG1fPHK5gU3qx06","type":0,"text":"Elemental Surge - Your spell's element flares. Add extra damage equal to the spell's damage die, of the spell's damage type.","img":"icons/svg/explosion.svg","weight":5,"range":[65,69],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1S","damageType":"spell"}}},{"_id":"z8N9scYMzoevr5Sm","type":0,"text":"Hex of Frailty - A hex of frailty erodes the target's defenses, giving them a -2 penalty to AC until removed.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":5,"range":[70,74],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"ac","penaltyValue":-2,"duration":-1}}},{"_id":"rgHXeArjF31NNnx4","type":0,"text":"Arcane Amplification - Your magical power surges! Deal additional force damage equal to the spell's damage die.","img":"icons/svg/explosion.svg","weight":4,"range":[75,78],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1S","damageType":"force"}}},{"_id":"353hwKDOKny0JuZ7","type":0,"text":"Concussive Blast - A concussive shockwave hammers the target; they must succeed on a DC 11 Strength save or be knocked prone.","img":"icons/svg/lightning.svg","weight":4,"range":[79,82],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"str","effectCondition":"prone"}}},{"_id":"abEU79Y3MVhG88xI","type":0,"text":"Withering Curse - A withering hex corrodes the target from within; they must succeed on a DC 11 Constitution save or be poisoned.","img":"icons/svg/poison.svg","weight":4,"range":[83,86],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"con","effectCondition":"poisoned"}}},{"_id":"o2PIxFx65miTMfjG","type":0,"text":"Searing Flash - A blinding burst of arcane light sears the target's eyes, leaving them blinded until the end of their next turn.","img":"icons/svg/blind.svg","weight":4,"range":[87,90],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"blinded","duration":0}}},{"_id":"TCn6IR2pf1Xv9iQb","type":0,"text":"Mind Spike - A lance of psychic force stabs the target's mind; they must succeed on a DC 11 Wisdom save or be frightened of you.","img":"icons/svg/terror.svg","weight":3,"range":[91,93],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"wis","effectCondition":"frightened"}}},{"_id":"1EcSEgSreoh96FxS","type":0,"text":"Magical Knockdown - The force of your spell knocks the target prone.","img":"icons/svg/falling.svg","weight":3,"range":[94,96],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"prone","duration":0}}},{"_id":"gPsZzQMfW2zOUBXh","type":0,"text":"Arcane Vulnerability - Your magic disrupts the target's defenses. Attacks against them have advantage until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","weight":2,"range":[97,98],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"grants","effectName":"Arcane Vulnerability","duration":1}}},{"_id":"TwEdEa8enaiXMTYP","type":0,"text":"Perfect Casting - A masterful spell! Deal maximum spell damage instead of rolling, plus the target is frightened of you until the end of their next turn.","img":"icons/svg/terror.svg","weight":2,"range":[99,100],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"frightened","duration":1}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"tier":1,"attackType":"spell","resultType":"crit"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1785615948582,"modifiedTime":1785615948582,"lastModifiedBy":"build-script"}}
{"_id":"EhFiHFoejVR39QDL","name":"Tier 1 Spell Fumbles (Levels 1-4)","description":"Fumble effects for spell attacks at Tier 1 (Levels 1-4). Effects are relatively mild for novice adventurers.","img":"icons/magic/fire/projectile-fireball-smoke-strong-orange.webp","formula":"1d100","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"results":[{"_id":"67SvKKCLBPbSpzTo","type":0,"text":"Nothing Special - Your spell fizzles harmlessly with no additional penalty.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":23,"range":[1,23],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"none"}}},{"_id":"qSgWwW7OtpkTCVxL","type":0,"text":"Grounded Magic - Your spell earths itself through your body. You have disadvantage on attack rolls until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":8,"range":[24,31],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Grounded Magic","duration":1}}},{"_id":"0hN3wAuPiXPCszie","type":0,"text":"Magical Feedback - The spell's energy rebounds slightly. Take 1d4 force damage.","img":"icons/svg/lightning.svg","weight":7,"range":[32,38],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1d4","damageType":"force"}}},{"_id":"hgcHqlturtrthecU","type":0,"text":"Spell Recoil - The spell lashes back as it leaves you. You have disadvantage on your next ranged spell attack.","img":"icons/svg/lightning.svg","weight":7,"range":[39,45],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"attack.rsak","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Spell Recoil","duration":0}}},{"_id":"CeKVJgJQI8eejipb","type":0,"text":"Arcane Hiccup - Your magic stutters and misfires. You have disadvantage on spell attacks until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":6,"range":[46,51],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":["attack.msak","attack.rsak"],"advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Arcane Hiccup","duration":1}}},{"_id":"B5UjJHyAWNWsLlkV","type":0,"text":"Somatic Cramp - Your casting hand cramps violently. You have disadvantage on concentration checks until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/daze.svg","weight":6,"range":[52,57],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"disadvantage","advantageScope":"concentration","advantageTarget":"self","effectName":"Somatic Cramp","duration":1}}},{"_id":"4yh2H7TaPH4rbM0i","type":0,"text":"Arcane Backlash - Raw magic rebounds into you. Take force damage equal to one of the spell's damage dice.","img":"icons/svg/explosion.svg","weight":5,"range":[58,62],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1S","damageType":"force"}}},{"_id":"kZtq9uFND8AT1iWi","type":0,"text":"Component Combustion - Your material components ignite in your grip. Take 1d6 fire damage.","img":"icons/svg/fire.svg","weight":5,"range":[63,67],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1d6","damageType":"fire"}}},{"_id":"HMD6LrgZOT2Wahju","type":0,"text":"Arcane Spark - Loose magic crackles across your skin. Take 1d6 force damage.","img":"icons/svg/explosion.svg","weight":5,"range":[68,72],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"damage","damageFormula":"1d6","damageType":"force"}}},{"_id":"eA8HPxZeXXIQgRnp","type":0,"text":"Telegraphed Magic - Your fumbled casting tips your hand. Enemies have advantage on their next saving throw against your spells.","img":"icons/svg/daze.svg","weight":4,"range":[73,76],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"save.all","advantageTarget":"grants","effectName":"Telegraphed Magic","duration":0}}},{"_id":"QpB4cOmmzIgGAffF","type":0,"text":"Exposed Weave - Your botched weave leaves you unguarded. Attacks against you have advantage until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":4,"range":[77,80],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"advantage","advantageScope":"attack.all","advantageTarget":"grants","effectName":"Exposed Weave","duration":1}}},{"_id":"pvyA4HgmsVRgK4B6","type":0,"text":"Warped Focus - The recoil throws off your aim. You take a -2 penalty to attack rolls until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","weight":4,"range":[81,84],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"attack","penaltyValue":-2,"duration":1}}},{"_id":"uZoF96WoixDDnQJe","type":0,"text":"Shattered Wards - The backlash shreds your protective wards. You take a -2 penalty to AC until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/hazard.svg","weight":4,"range":[85,88],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"penalty","penaltyType":"ac","penaltyValue":-2,"duration":1}}},{"_id":"1j0SjzCsEv7GhDvO","type":0,"text":"Backlash Sprawl - The detonation throws you off your feet. You are knocked prone.","img":"icons/svg/combat.svg","weight":3,"range":[89,91],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"prone","duration":0}}},{"_id":"6rYFLmPvwHgIkszV","type":0,"text":"Deafening Boom - The spell erupts with a deafening crack. You are deafened.","img":"icons/svg/explosion.svg","weight":3,"range":[92,94],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"deafened","duration":-1}}},{"_id":"QWR9FtpwJhxUXqu4","type":0,"text":"Blinding Feedback - A blinding flash of misfired magic sears your eyes. You are blinded until the end of your next turn.","img":"icons/svg/blind.svg","weight":2,"range":[95,96],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"condition","effectCondition":"blinded","duration":0}}},{"_id":"MTJfJt0ar6aWKmmZ","type":0,"text":"Catastrophic Rebound - Your spell collapses inward. Make a DC 11 Constitution saving throw or take 2d6 force damage and be knocked prone.","img":"icons/svg/terror.svg","weight":2,"range":[97,98],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"save","saveDC":11,"saveAbility":"con","damageFormula":"2d6","damageType":"force","effectCondition":"prone","failEffect":"Take force damage and be knocked prone"}}},{"_id":"Q7yiAyGuswKbKeU2","type":0,"text":"Wild Magic Surge - Your miscast tears a hole in the weave and raw chaos pours through. Resolve the wild magic surge below.","img":"icons/magic/lightning/orb-ball-purple.webp","weight":2,"range":[99,100],"documentCollection":"","documentId":null,"drawn":false,"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"effectType":"none","wildMagic":true}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"dorman-lakelys-crit-fumble-tables":{"tier":1,"attackType":"spell","resultType":"fumble"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1785615948582,"modifiedTime":1785615948582,"lastModifiedBy":"build-script"}}